						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13900320/in-an-alternate-universe-foundations-similar-to-scp-and-goc">In an alternate universe. Foundations similar to SCP and GOC have a war</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4840778">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Action</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A person with no record of existing claiming to be part of the 05 council seemingly teleports to a site. They warn us about a dangerous war happening 5 years in the future between the CID (Capture, Imprison, Defend) and the WWAC (WorldWide anomaly coalition) It turns out. The person warning us accidentally went to a parallel universe at the same time instead of time traveling 5 years before in their universe. The person is questioned and we learn about how the war started and what happened. Then we try to figure out how to send them back to their universe 5 years in the past.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> In the parallel universe, The CID finds an anomaly with reality-altering abilities and kill half of the 05 Council. The WWAC accidentally made the anomaly by trying to kill a different one. The CID learn about this and they try to start a war with them. Overruled by the ethics committee, they try to keep things peaceful. One 05 council member goes rogue and sends SCP-662 to eliminate the heads of the GOC. That's all I have so far but if this gets greenlighted, I will write the entire thing.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The SCP article takes place as a story (similar to SCP-5000) and the SCP foundation tries to get into contact with the GOC to tell them what happened and to avoid it.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I'm not that of an experienced writer and I may need help with this one.</p>

